  "description": "A castrati is a male singer who has had part of his genitals cut off to preserve his beautiful voice. Their heyday was during the 18th century, when Italian opera flourished. At the Pietà dei Turchini, a music school and monastery, the young castrato Nicola and the aspiring composer Patrick meet. They pledge an eternal friendship. However, their friendship is repeatedly tested...\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
